  "question": {
    "text": "The maximum electron density in the ionosphere in the morning is <math><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> At noon time, it increases to <math><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> Find the ratio of critical frequency at noon and the critical frequency in the morning."
  },
